    "text": "Magnetic moment <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math>  <br/>More than value of n, more will be magnetic moment. <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> electronic configuration; <br/><math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e881cbd5-9687-4f93-b0af-86e2811bf7e5-image39.png\"> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2.82</mn></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mtext>Ti</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/85139260-a4d8-4008-9e46-7b3144a52ff4-image40.png\"> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1.73</mn></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aba5ebe6-2763-4960-9f65-72fa92a3f825-image41.png\"> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3.87</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> no unpaired electron. <math><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  <br/>Hence Order of Magnetic Moment is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
